# PROOF does not require server secrets for its current architecture.
# Supabase Auth, PostgreSQL RLS and private Storage are accessed with a
# publishable browser key. The production project identifiers live in
# lib/supabase-browser.ts and are safe to expose by design.
#
# If you fork PROOF to your own Supabase project, replace the public URL and
# publishable key in lib/supabase-browser.ts.
